units         metal
dimension     3
atom_style    atomic
atom_modify   map array
boundary      p  p  p

pair_style    mlip mlip.ini
read_data     in.dat 
pair_coeff    *  * 

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

timestep     0.001

thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press
thermo 1000

minimize     0.0 1.0e-6 200000   2000000

write_data   out.dat
